Drop real assets here, e.g.:
- arjuna-hero.jpg      (ARJUNA buggy, dramatic dark background, red dust/light streaks)
- gallery/*.jpg        (race-day and build photos)
- events/*.jpg         (endurance / hill climb / rock crawl)
- partners/*.svg       (sponsor logos)

Live brand assets live in /views/:
- views/pce-crest.png         (Pillai College crest — background cleaned; checker removed)
- views/pce-crest-source.png  (original untouched crest render from the client)
- views/vrt-logo.png          (VRT phoenix logo — already true transparency, used as-is)
- views/vrt-logo-source.png   (identical source copy of the VRT logo)
- views/favicon.png           (96px VRT-logo favicon, generated by scripts/make-favicon.js)
